    "en": [
      "Ratanjit S. Sondhe Ratanjit S. Sondhe emigrated from India in 1968 with two Masters’ degrees and $8 in his pocket to complete his Ph.D. in polymer chemistry at Akron University. In 1973, he founded POLY-CARB, Inc."
